# MMM Portfolio — configuration values
#
# This is a STATIC site: there is no build step and no .env loader.
# These two values are the ONLY configuration the project needs, and they
# live in `data.js`, in the SUPABASE block near the top of the file:
#
#   SUPABASE: {
#     url:     '<SUPABASE_URL>',
#     anonKey: '<SUPABASE_ANON_KEY>'
#   },
#
# Copy the real values from: Supabase Dashboard → Settings → API
#   SUPABASE_URL      = your Project URL, e.g. https://abcdefgh.supabase.co
#   SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = the "anon public" key (or the newer "sb_publishable_…" key)
#
# SECURITY
#   • The anon/publishable key is designed to be public — RLS policies
#     (see supabase-setup.sql) are the actual protection.
#   • NEVER put the service_role key in this project or any frontend code.
